{"quest":{"line_id":"12010531","line_type":"5","order":278,"title":{"cn":"码头日常","en":"Dockside Daily","jp":"埠頭の日常","kr":"부두의 일상"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"202","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"血薇帮","en":"Carmine Whispers","jp":"ブラッディ・マリー","kr":"블러디 로즈"},"route":"#/season-2/daily/12010531","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246010"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246020"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:3"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_12010531:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246030"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246040"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246050"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:5"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_12010531:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246060"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246070"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246080"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010531:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12246090"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与卢卡交谈","en":"Talk to Lucca","jp":"ルカと話す","kr":"루카와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"血薇帮最近很忙，问问卢卡需要什么帮助。","en":"The Carmine Whispers have been as busy as bees lately. Ask Lucca if he needs help.","jp":"最近、ブラッディ・マリーは忙しいようだ。何か手伝えることがあるか、ルカに尋ねよう。","kr":"최근 블러디 로즈가 매우 바쁘다. 루카에게 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"前往码头","en":"Go to the Dock","jp":"埠頭へ向かう","kr":"부두로 이동"},"objective_description":{"cn":"卢卡让你去把工匠埃迪和水手奥特找回来。","en":"Lucca asks you to bring back Aldi the craftsman and Otto the sailor.","jp":"ルカは、職人アディーと水夫オルトを連れ戻すよう、あなたに頼んだ。","kr":"루카는 장인 에이디와 선원 오트를 찾아와 달라고 부탁했다."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"询问工匠埃迪","en":"Ask Aldi","jp":"アディーに話を聞く","kr":"에이디에게 묻기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"你找到了工匠埃迪，问问他什么时候回归工作岗位。","en":"There's Aldi. Ask him when he plans to return to work.","jp":"あなたはアディーを見つけた。いつになったら仕事に戻るのか、彼に尋ねよう。","kr":"장인 에이디를 찾아가 언제 다시 일터로 돌아올지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"玩一局牌","en":"Play a Round","jp":"一局遊ぶ","kr":"카드 게임 하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"工匠埃迪好像沉迷牌局，邀请你和他来一局就回去。","en":"Aldi seems to be engrossed in a card game. He invites you to join him for a round before getting back to work.","jp":"アディーは百物集に夢中になっているようで、あなたが一局付き合ってくれればすぐに戻ると言った。","kr":"카드 게임에 빠져있는 것 같은 장인 에이디는 자기와 한 판 놀아주면 돌아가겠다고 한다."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"询问水手奥特","en":"Ask Otto","jp":"水夫のオルトに尋ねる","kr":"선원 오트에게 물어보기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"你找到了水手奥特，问问他什么时候回归工作岗位。","en":"There's Otto. Ask him when he plans to return to work.","jp":"あなたはオルトを見つけた。いつになったら仕事に戻るのか、彼に尋ねよう。","kr":"선원 오트를 찾아가 언제 다시 일터로 돌아올지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮忙赶鸭子","en":"Round up Ducks","jp":"アヒル追いを手伝う","kr":"오리 몰아주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"水手奥特说只要你把鸭子赶回来，他就回去工作。","en":"Otto agrees to return to work after you help him round up the ducks.","jp":"オルトは、あなたがアヒルを連れ戻してくれたら、すぐに仕事に戻ると言った。","kr":"선원 오트는 오리를 몰아주면 돌아가겠다고 한다."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"告诉卢卡","en":"Tell Lucca","jp":"ルカに報告する","kr":"루카에게 알려주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"工匠埃迪和水手奥特都回去了，去告诉卢卡吧。","en":"Tell Lucca both Aldi and Otto have returned to work.","jp":"アディーとオルトが戻って来たことをルカに知らせよう。","kr":"장인 에이디와 선원 오트가 모두 돌아왔다. 루카에게 알려주자!"}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"12246010","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12246010","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12246010.asset","raw_sha256":"365616faa1f336567c3061ef526811654e1d2d8e36d8a2396791e8cc9edf0b90","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":9999504,"s